<section class="sec sec-uc" id="usecases">
  <div class="sec-wrap">
    <h2 class="sec-h2"><span class="ja">実際のアプリ画面</span><span class="en">The actual app</span></h2>
    <p class="sec-sub"><span class="ja">1つの解析ダッシュボードに、試合の読み方がまとまっています。参照できる粒度は役割によって異なります。</span><span class="en">One analysis dashboard brings the ways of reading a match together. How much detail you see depends on your role.</span></p>
    <figure class="app-fig">
      <div class="shot-frame">
        <img class="shot-light" src="/hero-app-light@2x.png" srcset="/hero-app-light.png 1000w, /hero-app-light@2x.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width:1180px) 1100px, 100vw" width="1920" height="830" alt="ShuttleScope の解析ダッシュボード画面" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <img class="shot-dark" src="/hero-app-dark@2x.png" srcset="/hero-app-dark.png 1000w, /hero-app-dark@2x.png 1920w" sizes="(min-width:1180px) 1100px, 100vw" width="1920" height="830" alt="ShuttleScope の解析ダッシュボード画面 (ダークテーマ)" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </div>
      <figcaption class="shot-cap"><span class="ja">解析ダッシュボード。開発用のテストデータで表示しています。</span><span class="en">The analysis dashboard, shown with development test data.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="shot-points">
      <li><span class="ja"><b>コートのヒートマップ</b>が、配球のかたよりをゾーンごとの濃淡で示します。</span><span class="en"><b>A court heatmap</b> shows where shots cluster, by zone.</span></li>
      <li><span class="ja"><b>ラリーの終わり方</b>が、横棒グラフで種類別に並びます。</span><span class="en"><b>Rally endings</b> line up by type in a bar chart.</span></li>
      <li><span class="ja"><b>ラリー長の分布</b>が、下段のグラフで見えます。</span><span class="en"><b>Rally length</b> appears as a distribution in the lower chart.</span></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="roles">
      <div class="role"><div class="role-h"><span class="ja">コーチ</span><span class="en">Coach</span></div><p class="role-p"><span class="ja">チーム全体の傾向を見て、練習の優先順位を決めます。</span><span class="en">Read team-wide tendencies and set practice priorities.</span></p></div>
      <div class="role"><div class="role-h"><span class="ja">アナリスト</span><span class="en">Analyst</span></div><p class="role-p"><span class="ja">ストロークと局面を掘り下げ、対戦相手の傾向をまとめます。</span><span class="en">Dig into strokes and phases and summarise an opponent's tendencies.</span></p></div>
      <div class="role"><div class="role-h"><span class="ja">選手</span><span class="en">Player</span></div><p class="role-p"><span class="ja">自分の試合の記録を振り返ります。</span><span class="en">Look back at the records of your own matches.</span></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

