            <text class="t-acc" x="222" y="90" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="ja">優勢が動いた局面</tspan><tspan class="en">Where the lead moved</tspan></text>
          </svg>
          <p class="mini-cap"><span class="ja">帯は推定の幅。記録が少ないほど広がります。</span><span class="en">The band shows the range of the estimate and widens when less is recorded.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vtext">
        <h3 class="view-h"><span class="ja">得点の推移を、折れ線で追う</span><span class="en">Follow the score progression on a line graph</span></h3>
        <p class="view-p"><span class="ja">ラリーごとの優勢度の推移を折れ線で表示します。優勢が大きく動いた局面から、動画で見返したい場面を選べます。</span><span class="en">Plot how the advantage shifts rally by rally. From the points where the lead swung most, jump to the moment you want to review on video.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="note"><span class="ja">どの表示も、記録された範囲の傾向を示すものです。試合数やラリー数が少ないときは信頼度を併記し、断定はしません。</span><span class="en">Every view shows trends within what was recorded. When there are few matches or rallies, a confidence level is shown alongside and results are never presented as certain.</span></p>
    <details class="method"><summary><span class="ja">分析方法</span><span class="en">How it is calculated</span></summary><p class="method-p"><span class="ja">推定には Markov モデルと EPV (得点期待値) を用いています。Markov モデルはラリー内のショットのつながりから次の展開を読みます。EPV はその1球が得点にどれだけ近づけたかを測ります。どちらも記録したストロークから計算するため、試合やラリーが少ないほど推定の幅は広くなります。</span><span class="en">Estimates use a Markov model and EPV (expected point value). The Markov model reads how shots connect within a rally to see what tends to follow. EPV measures how much a single shot moved you toward winning the point. Both are computed from the strokes you record, so the range widens when there are fewer matches or rallies.</span></p></details>
  </div>
</section>

